      "source": "<a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditingHandler</code></a> extension that uses <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html#isNew(java.lang.Object)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isNew(Object)</code></a> to expose a generic\n<a href=\"../IsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html#markAudited(java.lang.Object)\"><code>IsNewAwareAuditingHandler.markAudited(Object)</code></a> method that will route calls to <a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html#markCreated(T)\"><code>AuditingHandler.markCreated(Object)</code></a> or\n<a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html#markModified(T)\"><code>AuditingHandler.markModified(Object)</code></a> based on the <a href=\"../../support/IsNewStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.support\"><code>IsNewStrategy</code></a> determined from the factory.",
